diff --git a/GENO.md b/GENO.md
index 28d5e79..c0f5780 100644
--- a/GENO.md
+++ b/GENO.md
@@ -75,5 +75,5 @@ Pure markdown skillset — no Python package, no venv, no scripts. Each skill is
